      "id": 79453,
      "is_admin": true,
      "is_moderator": true,
      "is_staff": true,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "<a href=\"https://torrentpier.com/members/2634/\">@sasha20072007</a> проблема из-за немного некорректной установки. <br />\n<br />\nПеред: <br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"html\">&lt;/script&gt;\n&lt;a style=&quot;cursor: help; color: #800000;&quot; title=&quot;{L_EDIT_TOPIC_TITLE}&quot; onclick=&quot;edit_topic_title(&#039;edit&#039;); return false&quot; href=&quot;#&quot;&gt;&amp;para;&lt;/a&gt;</pre>Вставить:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"html\">ajax.admin_change_poster = function(post_id) {\n    user = prompt(&quot;Введите user_id или username&quot;, &quot;&quot;);\n    if(user) {\n        ajax.exec({\n            action   : &#039;admin_change_poster&#039;,\n            mode     : &#039;change_poster_id&#039;,\n            post_id  : post_id,\n            user     : user,\n        });\n        ajax.callback.admin_change_poster = function(data) {\n            if(data.url) document.location.href = data.url;\n        };\n    }\n}</pre>Ну и ссылка для смены id сообщения:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"html\">                &lt;!-- IF IS_ADMIN --&gt;\n                &amp;middot; &lt;a class=&quot;small&quot; onclick=&quot;ajax.admin_change_poster({postrow.POST_ID}); return false;&quot; href=&quot;#&quot;&gt;Сменить автора&lt;/a&gt;\n                &lt;!-- ENDIF --&gt;</pre>",
